ine was based on Assembly and executed by a single worker, 7 Billion Humans has an all new language that lots of workers can all execute at the same time.<br></li><li>You'll be taught everything you need to know. Even useless skills can be put to work!<br></li><li>Feeling stressed out? There are now friendly hint and &quot;skip&quot; systems to facilitate your career's ascent.<br></li><li>Available in English, French, Italian, German, Spanish, Dutch, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Brazilian Portuguese, and Russian. With more languages on the way!<br></li><li>Incomprehensible cutscenes! You will be delighted and bewildered.<br></li><li>New soundtrack by Kyle Gabler included alongside the game.<br></li><li>From the creators of Human Resource Machine, Little Inferno, and World of Goo.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/792100/extras/398bc3c3077d641faae15b10e305f6b5.poster.avif?t=1667105092\" width=310 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/792100/extras/398bc3c3077d641faae15b10e305f6b5.webm?t=1667105092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/792100/extras/398bc3c3077d641faae15b10e305f6b5.mp4?t=1667105092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/792100/extras/9b3b4efa06c933c827106c1754bce3b2.poster.avif?t=1667105092\" width=230 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/792100/extras/9b3b4efa06c933c827106c1754bce3b2.webm?t=1667105092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/792100/extras/9b3b4efa06c933c827106c1754bce3b2.mp4?t=1667105092\" 